TSMC was basically a state-owned
company from the beginning.

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:43.003
So yeah,

00:14:43.003 --> 00:14:45.090
Taiwan's now in the
game and semiconductors

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:48.930
