00:32:29.880 --> 00:32:31.020
Tom Fox is our composer.

00:32:31.020 --> 00:32:34.060
You get royalty free music
that you can use in your videos

00:32:34.060 --> 00:32:35.910
if you are a member of the Newsroom

00:32:35.910 --> 00:32:37.350
and you get the warm fuzzy feeling

00:32:37.350 --> 00:32:39.570
of supporting independent journalism.

00:32:39.570 --> 00:32:43.380
So the newsroom is over on
patreon.com/JohnnyHarris.

00:32:43.380 --> 00:32:45.480
Another thing that I should
mention is that we have LUTs

00:32:45.480 --> 00:32:47.970
and presets, which are like
a thing that you can buy

00:32:47.970 --> 00:32:50.594
and then you can color
your video or your photos

00:32:50.594 --> 00:32:51.870
in the way that we color it.

00:32:51.870 --> 00:32:53.040
We worked with the professional colorist

00:32:53.040 --> 00:32:54.180
to develop these things.

00:32:54.180 --> 00:32:58.110
They're basically presets and
they are for photo and video

00:32:58.110 --> 00:33:01.470
and they look really nice
because I like things

00:33:01.470 --> 00:33:02.303
to look nice.

00:33:02.303 --> 00:33:04.740
And welcome to all the
new subscribers here.

00:33:04.740 --> 00:33:07.440
There's been a lot of new people
around the channel lately,

00:33:07.440 --> 00:33:11.193
and it's fun to have this community grow.

00:33:12.330 --> 00:33:15.630
So I'm gonna keep telling
stories and being curious

00:33:15.630 --> 00:33:18.570
and learning and looking
for evidence and data

00:33:18.570 --> 00:33:19.920
and questioning my assumptions

00:33:19.920 --> 00:33:22.110
and I appreciate you all being here.

00:33:22.110 --> 00:33:25.533
So I'll see you in the next one, bye.

